dance Slow_Rewind
// The middle pushes the morph; the snares bring it nearer; the middle sets how fast it spins and
// the bass turns it; drops in the highs reverse it.
// Inspired by reversor slow, a DancerDNA music style.

morph follows music.mid  speed 0.8  settle 0.17
zoom follows music.mid_hit  amount 0.5  settle 68.5
spin follows music.mid  from 183 to 22.9  smooth 0.6
turn on music.bass changes  by 0.53
reverse on music.high drops  by 0.51  on 4 off 4
